# Payments & subscriptions

- Never build payment logic yourself — integrate the gateway.
- State is driven by gateway WEBHOOKS, not client callbacks.
- All charge/subscription calls use idempotency keys.
- Subscription lifecycle (renew, expire, 1-week grace, revoke) via Celery Beat + webhooks.
- On successful payment: async-generate signed QR ticket, then fan out to
  WhatsApp + email + in-app within 60s.
- Store no raw card data. Support cards, Apple/Google Pay, and cash-on-arrival.